    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 25 April 2025, the existing use of 207 Ellerdine Road, Hounslow, TW3 2PZ as two self-contained flats was not lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\nThere is sufficient contradictory evidence hence, on the balance of probabilities, it is considered that the property has not been in use as two self-contained flats for a continuous period of four years.\r\n"
